PhoneBox 0.6.9 — panel: only the visible page is updated.
Why: emit() updated cur ± 1 pages on every event (activeSet); the off-screen neighbour paid DOM + canvas work every second.
- activeSet(): visible page (+ floor/ceil of the scroll position); neighbours only while a finger is on the pager or a settle is running.
- touchstart: dirty widgets of the neighbours are refreshed once (no stale value under the finger).
Measured (headless Chromium, 873x393 touch, CPU x4, 10 s at 1 Hz): off-screen page 82 DOM mutations / 400 canvas calls -> 0 / 0.
Mutant: restoring cur ± 1 turns the test red.

